    {
      "id": "build-analysis-prompt",
      "name": "Code: Build Analysis Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const trade = $('Set: Extract Trade Fields').first().json;\nconst strategyData = $('HTTP: Fetch Strategy Rules').first().json;\nconst marketData = $('HTTP: Fetch Market Data at Entry').first().json;\nconst vixData = $('HTTP: Fetch VIX at Entry').first().json;\nconst similarTrades = $('HTTP: Fetch Similar Past Trades').first().json;\n\n// Calculate trade metrics\nconst pnlPercent = ((trade.exitPrice - trade.entryPrice) / trade.entryPrice * 100);\nconst durationMs = new Date(trade.exitTime) - new Date(trade.entryTime);\nconst durationMinutes = durationMs / 60000;\n\n// Parse similar trades safely\nconst similar = Array.isArray(similarTrades?.trades) ? similarTrades.trades : [];\nconst avgPnL = similar.length > 0 \n  ? similar.reduce((s, t) => s + (t.pnl || 0), 0) / similar.length \n  : 0;\nconst winRate = similar.length > 0 \n  ? (similar.filter(t => (t.pnl || 0) > 0).length / similar.length * 100).toFixed(0)\n  : 'N/A';\n\n// Get VIX value\nconst vixValue = vixData?.results?.[0]?.c || 'N/A';\n\n// Get market range\nconst marketResults = marketData?.results || [];\nconst marketLow = marketResults.length > 0 ? Math.min(...marketResults.map(r => r.l)) : 'N/A';\nconst marketHigh = marketResults.length > 0 ? Math.max(...marketResults.map(r => r.h)) : 'N/A';\n\n// Strategy rules\nconst strategyRules = strategyData?.rules || strategyData || 'No strategy rules found';\n\nconst prompt = `You are TheProfessor, a rigorous trading analyst. Grade this trade objectively.\n\nTRADE DETAILS:\n- Trade ID: ${trade.tradeId}\n- Symbol: ${trade.symbol}\n- Direction: ${trade.direction}\n- Entry: $${trade.entryPrice} at ${trade.entryTime}\n- Exit: $${trade.exitPrice} at ${trade.exitTime}\n- Duration: ${durationMinutes.toFixed(0)} minutes\n- P&L: $${trade.pnl} (${pnlPercent >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${pnlPercent.toFixed(2)}%)\n- Strategy: ${trade.strategy}\n- Agent: ${trade.agentId}\n\nSTRATEGY RULES:\n${typeof strategyRules === 'string' ? strategyRules : JSON.stringify(strategyRules, null, 2)}\n\nMARKET CONTEXT AT ENTRY:\n- VIX: ${vixValue}\n- Price range (30m window): $${marketLow} - $${marketHigh}\n\nSIMILAR PAST TRADES (same symbol/strategy, last 10):\n- Sample size: ${similar.length}\n- Average P&L: $${avgPnL.toFixed(2)}\n- Historical win rate: ${winRate}%\n\nGRADING CRITERIA:\n1. Entry Quality (25%): Was the entry at an optimal level per strategy rules?\n2. Exit Quality (25%): Did we exit at the right time? Premature or late?\n3. Risk Management (25%): Was position sizing appropriate? Stop-loss honored?\n4. Strategy Adherence (25%): Did the trade follow the strategy's rules?\n\nProvide your analysis as JSON:\n{\n  \"grade\": \"A|A-|B+|B|B-|C+|C|C-|D|F\",\n  \"score\": 0-100,\n  \"entry_quality\": { \"score\": 0-100, \"notes\": \"brief explanation\" },\n  \"exit_quality\": { \"score\": 0-100, \"notes\": \"brief explanation\" },\n  \"risk_management\": { \"score\": 0-100, \"notes\": \"brief explanation\" },\n  \"strategy_adherence\": { \"score\": 0-100, \"notes\": \"brief explanation\" },\n  \"strengths\": [\"max 3 items\"],\n  \"weaknesses\": [\"max 3 items\"],\n  \"lessons\": [\"max 2 actionable lessons\"],\n  \"pattern_detected\": \"premature_exit|perfect_execution|overtrading|revenge_trade|fomo_entry|none\",\n  \"recommendation\": \"one sentence actionable recommendation\"\n}\n\nBe honest but constructive. A profitable trade is not automatically an A.`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    prompt: prompt,\n    trade: trade,\n    context: {\n      vix: vixValue,\n      marketRange: { low: marketLow, high: marketHigh },\n      similarTradesCount: similar.length,\n      historicalAvgPnL: avgPnL,\n      historicalWinRate: winRate\n    }\n  }\n};"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "openclaw-professor",
      "name": "HTTP: Call OpenClaw Professor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1340, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:3300/webhook/professor-grade",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ \"message\": $json.prompt, \"tradeId\": $json.trade.tradeId }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": false
            }
          }
        }
      }
